{
  "_comment": [
    "Plugin registry compiled into the build, used when the hosted registry at",
    "pm.auru.studio is unreachable or has not been fetched yet.",
    "",
    "Entries are keyed by plugin identity as written by PluginId's Display:",
    "  vst2:<UniqueId>            from VstPluginInfo/UniqueId",
    "  vst3:<f0>-<f1>-<f2>-<f3>   from Vst3PluginInfo/Uid/Fields.0..3",
    "  live:<ElementTag>          a device built into Ableton Live",
    "",
    "Only identities that have been read out of a real project belong here.",
    "A VST3 class id cannot be guessed from a plugin's name, and an entry under",
    "a wrong identity is worse than no entry: it would attach one plugin's",
    "vendor and link to a different plugin entirely. The hosted registry is",
    "where the broad catalogue is maintained.",
    "",
    "This file never contains licences, licence keys, activation data, or",
    "installers. It says what a plugin is and where its maker distributes it."
  ],
